## Title: Pretty Wide Quest Log
## Notes: A wide, resizable dual-pane quest log with quest levels, dungeon and elite tags, rewards, quest chains, and a quest map for every quest. Share quests with your party and auto-announce dungeon quests. Works with Questie, VoiceOver, and ElvUI.
## Author: Gogo1951

